"The journal %(journal)s keeps a cash register, so the payment method "
"%(method)s needs an outstanding account of its own, other than the cash "
"account %(cash)s of the journal. The register line brings the money from "
"that account into the cash one, and there is nothing to bring in otherwise."
msgstr ""

